    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Anonymous read access to the eridu.ai media library — logos, leadership portraits, diagrams and press imagery with their generated size variants.\n\nEridu publishes no developer program, no developer portal and no product API. This document is an API Evangelist derivation of the only machine-readable interface the company serves — the WordPress core REST API behind eridu.ai — captured from the provider's own live self-describing route index on 2026-08-12. It is read-only and anonymously readable; write methods exist on the same routes but require a WordPress user with an application password.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Eridu",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
